github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115943#issuecomment-3860823321","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115943","id":3860823321,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7mH30Z","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-06T14:37:03Z","updated_at":"2026-02-06T14:37:03Z","body":"I don't think this should apply to settings which were registered using `add_property_info`. This makes the custom settings section of plugins look very strange.\r\n\r\n\r\n A disclosure that a setting is not builtin but from a plugin would be fine, but this presentation is overkill for installed and active plugins.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3860823321/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":4,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3861364408","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115943#issuecomment-3861364408","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115943","id":3861364408,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7mJ764","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-06T16:31:14Z","updated_at":"2026-02-06T16:31:14Z","body":"I agree with the others; the specific styling here feels like it's raising alarms, and if I know *for a fact* that a bunch of settings have been intentionally added (and are not deprecated etc), then it'll eventually lead me to disregard the warnings as a whole.\r\n\r\nIf there's a way to detect that a setting is from a custom addon or something of the like, then perhaps it could receive different styling that's less indicative of a problem or warning; meanwhile, a setting that has been explicitly marked as deprecated in Godot could receive this styling.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3861364408/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3913565091","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115943#issuecomment-3913565091","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115943","id":3913565091,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7pREOj","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-17T10:02:15Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T10:03:09Z","body":"I support the idea, which solves a lot of confusion over the years with users wondering why settings are kept in their project/editor settings when they've been removed from the engine or they disabled a plugin (see e.g. #116393 just today, we can find a bunch of duplicates of the same UX issue).\r\n\r\nI agree with the feedback so far that the warning should only be shown for plugins which can reliably be identified as obsolete. If they're registered by a plugin/extension or added manually by the user, they shouldn't be flagged with a warning icon. They could _maybe_ be flagged with a grey info icon on the other hand, to let users know that the setting was added by a plugin or by themselves. Not sure how feasible it is to track this.\r\n\r\nAs for the warning, showing a yellow icon is properly sufficient, so the text doesn't need to be tinted if that's the option we go for.\r\n\r\nAnother thing worth considering (maybe for a separate PR) would be a button to remove outdated settings. (Like the \"Remove Missing Projects\" in the project manager.)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3913565091/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3913583937","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115943#issuecomment-3913583937","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115943","id":3913583937,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7pRI1B","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-17T10:05:22Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T10:05:22Z","body":"> Another thing worth considering (maybe for a separate PR) would be a button to remove outdated settings. (Like the \"Remove Missing Projects\" in the project manager.)\r\n\r\nI'd be cautious about that, at least for editor settings, since you might very well be deleting editor preferences of a plugin that you are using in a different project.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3913583937/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]